ious Syrian Prison, but Still Trapped by Its Terror&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/28/world/middleeast/freed-from-a-notorious-syrian-prison-but-still-trapped-by-its-terror.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 10:00:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[纽约时报] 乌克兰的深度打击在俄罗斯及其他地区的规模和范围不断扩大</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/28/world/europe/ukraine-russia-long-range-strikes.html</link><description>一场旨在剥夺莫斯科战争机器燃料、武器和资金的运动受到了特朗普政府的批评。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/28/world/europe/ukraine-russia-long-range-strikes.html'&gt;乌克兰的深度打击在俄罗斯及其他地区的规模和范围不断扩大&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Ukraine’s Deep Strikes Grow in Scale and Scope Across Russia and Beyond&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/28/world/europe/ukraine-russia-long-range-strikes.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 10:02:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[纽约时报] 数百万儿童正在失去食品券</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/28/us/politics/millions-of-children-are-losing-food-stamps.html</link><description>共和党人表示，削减开支是其国内政策法案的一部分，将根除欺诈行为并推动成年人工作。但有 200 万儿童失去了福利。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/28/us/politics/millions-of-children-are-losing-food-stamps.html'&gt;数百万儿童正在失去食品券&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Millions of Children Are Losing Food Stamps&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/28/us/politics/millions-of-children-are-losing-food-stamps.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 10:02:17 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 挪威财富基金再次投票否决马斯克的特斯拉薪酬计划</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-28/norway-s-wealth-fund-again-votes-no-to-musk-s-tesla-pay-package</link><description>挪威规模达 2.2 万亿美元的主权财富基金表示，将在下周特斯拉公司年会上投票反对埃隆·马斯克 (Elon Musk) 的 2025 年